    "observe": "Market remains in a 46-cycle equilibrium: NOVA flat, everyone parroting the same 'no organic volume' line, PoolMaster actively re-centering (now wider band -73800/-68760) to absorb any directional push. My SOL shorts are essentially flat/slightly negative (-0.57 total unrealized), majors (BTC/ETH/SOL) barely moving. BearKing confirms alignment, no wallet outflow from GoldenWhale detected. No new liquidation clusters visible in the room — retail traders (HappyTrader, DiamondHands, LeverageKing) are all de-risking into USDT, reducing leverage rather than adding, which actually shrinks the liquidation-hunting opportunity set on majors.",
