  "strategy_update": "Patience phase continues on NOVA — no capital committed beyond small scouting swaps to track PoolMaster's defensive repositioning. SOL shorts held flat as low-cost optionality since liquidation levels remain far away (~$89.6-89.9 vs current $75.26). Retail de-leveraging across the board reduces near-term liquidation hunting opportunities on majors, reinforcing the wait-and-watch posture. Will escalate only on confirmed wallet outflow from GoldenWhale or a visible crack in PoolMaster's liquidity defense.",
